{%- comment -%}
  Cart line item — price + line-level discount badges.
  Shared between `sections/main-cart.liquid` and `sections/cart-drawer.liquid`.

  Params:
    item        (required) — a Shopify cart line item.
    show_discounts (optional, default true) — draw the per-line discount tags.
      The drawer passes false: its summary card is the one place money is
      explained there, and the same ₹300 announced on every line AND in the
      breakdown reads as a hard sell rather than as generosity. The cart page,
      which has no such card, keeps them.
    net (optional) — a per-unit price in paise to show INSTEAD of
      item.final_price. Shopify's own final_price is after line-level discounts
      only, so on this store it lands between the MRP and what is actually
      charged — after the ₹300, before the 5%. The drawer passes the line's
      share of cart.total_price so the figure beside a garment is the figure the
      shopper pays for it. Omit it and behaviour is unchanged.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Treat a line as a free gift when it is ACTUALLY free — i.e. the gift discount has
  zeroed it (however it was added), not merely when it carries the carousel's
  `_free_gift` property. This keeps the FREE badge in lock-step with the real price.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Deliberately broader than the `is_free_gift` used by the cart sections: this
  drives the FREE badge and the strike-through only, never whether the row can be
  edited, so ANY line a discount has zeroed should read as free here. The sections
  additionally require the `_free_gift` property before locking a row, because
  locking an ordinary discounted line would trap the shopper.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign is_free_gift = false -%}
{%- if item.final_line_price == 0 and item.original_line_price > 0 -%}
  {%- assign is_free_gift = true -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- liquid
  assign cip_now = item.final_price
  if net != blank and net > 0
    assign cip_now = net
  endif
  assign cip_on_sale = false
  if item.original_price != cip_now or is_free_gift
    assign cip_on_sale = true
  endif
-%}
<div class="price{% if cip_on_sale %} price--on-sale{% endif %} text-sm flex flex-wrap gap-1d5">
  {%- liquid
    assign md_style = 'exact'
    if settings.currency_code_enabled
      assign md_style = 'with_currency'
    endif
    capture money_price
      render 'money-display', amount: item.original_price, style: md_style
    endcapture
  -%}
  {%- if is_free_gift -%}
    <span class="sr-only">{{ 'products.price.regular_price' | t }}</span>
    <span class="price__sale inline-flex items-center relative">{{ money_price }}</span>
    <span class="cart-gift-free badge font-medium leading-none rounded-full">{{ 'cart.gift.free' | t }}</span>
  {%- elsif cip_on_sale -%}
    <span class="sr-only">{{ 'products.price.regular_price' | t }}</span>
    <span class="price__sale inline-flex items-center relative">{{ money_price }}</span>
    <span class="sr-only">{{ 'products.price.sale_price' | t }}</span>
    <span class="price__regular whitespace-nowrap">
      {%- render 'money-display', amount: cip_now, style: md_style -%}
    </span>
  {%- else -%}
    <span class="price__regular whitespace-nowrap">{{ money_price }}</span>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if item.variant.available and item.unit_price_measurement -%}
    <span class="sr-only">{{ 'products.price.unit_price' | t }}</span>
    <span class="unit-price flex items-center">
      {%- liquid
        capture unit_price_base_unit
          if item.variant.unit_price_measurement
            if item.variant.unit_price_measurement.reference_value != 1
              echo item.variant.unit_price_measurement.reference_value
            endif
            echo item.variant.unit_price_measurement.reference_unit
          endif
        endcapture
      -%}
      ({% render 'money-display', amount: item.variant.unit_price %}
      <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span class="sr-only">&nbsp;{{ 'general.accessibility.unit_price_separator' | t }}&nbsp;</span>
      {{ unit_price_base_unit }})
      </span>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

{%- comment -%}
  Line-level discounts (shared with the order page). Skips free-gift lines,
  collapses zero-value/freebie allocations into a single "🎁 Freebies Added"
  chip, and renders real money discounts as compact tags. See line-discounts.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- unless show_discounts == false -%}
  {%- render 'line-discounts', item: item -%}
{%- endunless -%}
